## Explicit non-goals

- Changing DF's configured UI scale, desired grid size, resolution, window
  mode, or physical OS cursor.
- Exposing map-tile coordinates as a pointer-position input space.
- Treating UI-grid cells and map tiles as equivalent.
- Adding a public UI-geometry or scaling command.
- Reworking keyboard input, text input, subject resolution, native attachment,
  or render scheduling beyond the pointer synchronization they invoke.
- Replacing DFHack's `simulateInput()` routing.
- Adding consumer-specific pointer workarounds outside DwarfSpec.
